{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,260p' convex/archiveEntries.ts\"","aggregated_output":"import { v } from 'convex/values';\n\nexport const archiveEntryKindValidator = v.union(\n  v.literal('user_message'),\n  v.literal('model_message'),\n  v.literal('reasoning'),\n  v.literal('script_emission'),\n  v.literal('tool_call'),\n  v.literal('tool_result'),\n  v.literal('process_event'),\n);\n\nexport const archiveEntryLifecycleStateValidator = v.literal('finalized');\n\nexport const archiveBodyFormatValidator = v.union(\n  v.literal('plain_text'),\n  v.literal('markdown'),\n  v.literal('structured'),\n  v.literal('none'),\n);\n\nexport const archiveEntryStatusValidator = v.union(v.literal('ready'), v.literal('degraded'));\n\nexport const archiveEntryBodyDataValidator = v.object({\n  jsonText: v.string(),\n});\n\nexport const archiveEntriesTableFields = {\n  projectId: v.string(),\n  processId: v.id('processes'),\n  entryKind: archiveEntryKindValidator,\n  sequence: v.number(),\n  lifecycleState: archiveEntryLifecycleStateValidator,\n  finalizationKey: v.string(),\n  sourceObjectId: v.union(v.string(), v.null()),\n  bodyText: v.union(v.string(), v.null()),\n  bodyData: v.union(archiveEntryBodyDataValidator, v.null()),\n  bodyFormat: archiveBodyFormatValidator,\n  relatedArtifactVersionId: v.union(v.id('artifactVersions'), v.null()),\n  relatedSourceProvenanceId: v.union(v.string(), v.null()),\n  relatedToolCallId: v.union(v.string(), v.null()),\n  entryStatus: archiveEntryStatusValidator,\n  degradationReason: v.union(v.string(), v.null()),\n  recordedAt: v.string(),\n};\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,220p' docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/014-verify.json\"","aggregated_output":"{\"command\":\"story-verify\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"revise\",\"result\":{\"resultId\":\"7aae033e-6dc5-429b-b085-57be01e86ceb\",\"role\":\"story_verifier\",\"provider\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.4\",\"sessionId\":\"019df617-f545-7c12-973a-19e600231531\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019df617-f545-7c12-973a-19e600231531\",\"storyId\":\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\"},\"mode\":\"followup\",\"story\":{\"id\":\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\",\"title\":\"Story 1: Canonical Archive Entry Persistence\"},\"artifactsRead\":[\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\",\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\",\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\"],\"reviewScopeSummary\":\"Follow-up convergence under impl-lead ruling 012: rechecked the updated Story 1 scope/mapping docs against the current `convex/archiveEntries` and `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` surfaces, then reran the targeted Story 1 test and the configured story gate to validate current readiness.\",\"priorFindingStatuses\":[{\"id\":\"S1-F1\",\"status\":\"resolved\",\"rationale\":\"Impl-lead ruling 012 and the updated story/test-plan/tech-design text now consistently judge Story 1 on the primitive append/read boundary only. The story now rewrites AC-1.1 and AC-1.4 to primitive-level behavior and maps TC-1.1a/b/c and TC-1.4a/b to `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:51-97`, `156-178`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md:44-54`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:563-569`). The prior scope dispute is closed.\"},{\"id\":\"S1-F2\",\"status\":\"resolved\",\"rationale\":\"The prior `collect()`-then-slice observation no longer applies because the cited `listArchiveEntries` implementation is not present in the current `convex/archiveEntries.ts`. That concern is superseded by the new blocking regression below: the Story 1 append/read primitive exports are now absent entirely.\"}],\"newFindings\":[{\"id\":\"S1-F3\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"The current archiveEntries module no longer exports the Story 1 append/read primitive, and the story gate now fails\",\"evidence\":\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts` currently contains only validators and `archiveEntriesTableFields` (`convex/archiveEntries.ts:1-45`); it does not export `appendArchiveEntry` or `listArchiveEntries`. `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` still imports those symbols at `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:1-3`, so the targeted Story 1 test now fails immediately with `_handler` undefined, and `corepack pnpm run green-verify` fails in typecheck with `TS2305: Module './archiveEntries.js' has no exported member 'appendArchiveEntry'` and `listArchiveEntries`. A repo search over `convex` and `apps/platform` found no replacement mutation/query export for these primitive functions. This removes the executable Story 1 persistence surface and breaks the configured story gate.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\",\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-1.1\",\"TC-1.1a\",\"TC-1.1b\",\"TC-1.1c\",\"AC-1.2\",\"TC-1.2a\",\"TC-1.2b\",\"AC-1.3\",\"TC-1.3a\",\"TC-1.3b\",\"AC-1.4\",\"TC-1.4a\",\"TC-1.4b\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true}],\"openFindings\":[{\"id\":\"S1-F3\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"The current archiveEntries module no longer exports the Story 1 append/read primitive, and the story gate now fails\",\"evidence\":\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts` currently contains only validators and `archiveEntriesTableFields` (`convex/archiveEntries.ts:1-45`); it does not export `appendArchiveEntry` or `listArchiveEntries`. `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` still imports those symbols at `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:1-3`, so the targeted Story 1 test now fails immediately with `_handler` undefined, and `corepack pnpm run green-verify` fails in typecheck with `TS2305: Module './archiveEntries.js' has no exported member 'appendArchiveEntry'` and `listArchiveEntries`. A repo search over `convex` and `apps/platform` found no replacement mutation/query export for these primitive functions. This removes the executable Story 1 persistence surface and breaks the configured story gate.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\",\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-1.1\",\"TC-1.1a\",\"TC-1.1b\",\"TC-1.1c\",\"AC-1.2\",\"TC-1.2a\",\"TC-1.2b\",\"AC-1.3\",\"TC-1.3a\",\"TC-1.3b\",\"AC-1.4\",\"TC-1.4a\",\"TC-1.4b\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true}],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[],\"unverified\":[\"AC-1.1\",\"TC-1.1a\",\"TC-1.1b\",\"TC-1.1c\",\"AC-1.2\",\"TC-1.2a\",\"TC-1.2b\",\"AC-1.3\",\"TC-1.3a\",\"TC-1.3b\",\"AC-1.4\",\"TC-1.4a\",\"TC-1.4b\"]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run convex/archiveEntries.test.ts --environment node\",\"result\":\"fail\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"fail\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"not-run\"}],\"productionPathFindings\":[\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts` no longer provides the real Story 1 runtime path for archive entry append/read; only schema validators remain, so the production primitive itself is missing.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"revise\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"The earlier human-ruling blocker is closed: the story, tech design, and test plan now consistently scope Story 1 to primitive append/read behavior only.\",\"No fake adapter, shim, or placeholder execution branch was found in the current runtime surface; the blocking issue is that the runtime primitive exports are absent, not that a fake path replaced them.\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/014-verify.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-05-05T03:37:46.875Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-05-05T03:41:06.983Z\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
